- Secure handling of external video URLs.
- Secure HTTP headers where appropriate.
- Environment-variable validation.
- Proper error messages that do not leak internal stack traces or secrets.
- Appropriate logging without recording passwords, session tokens, or sensitive information.

Do not rely on hiding dashboard links or checking authentication only in middleware or client components. Every protected server operation must verify authorization independently.

